{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_011Cg1zUPcGbCTAop2gmRE2k", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<message to=\"discord-main\">\n**$3,000 / 4 people \u2014 what that buys**\n\n$750pp is a solid road-trip or short-haul budget, but tight for long-haul flights (4 international tickets alone would eat 60\u201380% of it). So here's a 6-day drive-to trip outline \u2014 tell me your home city and I'll make it specific.\n\n**Outline**\n- **Day 1** \u2014 Drive out (3\u20135 hrs), grocery stop, settle into a rental with a kitchen\n- **Day 2** \u2014 Big free day: hike / beach / park. Pack lunch\n- **Day 3** \u2014 The one paid attraction (aquarium, boat trip, theme park)\n- **Day 4** \u2014 Slow day. Town wander, market, one nice sit-down dinner\n- **Day 5** \u2014 Second outdoor day + a short scenic detour\n- **Day 6** \u2014 Drive home, lunch on the road\n\n**Budget**\n| Item | Cost |\n|---|---|\n| Fuel + tolls/parking | $300 |\n| Lodging (5 nights \u00d7 ~$190, whole rental) | $950 |\n| Food (cook ~half, eat out ~half) | $700 |\n| Activities + entry fees | $450 |\n| Misc / souvenirs | $250 |\n| **Buffer** | **$350** |\n\n**Where the money is won:** a rental with a kitchen beats two hotel rooms, and cooking breakfast every day saves roughly $300 over the week.\n\nWant me to re-cut this for a specific destination, or price out a flight-based version instead?\n</message>"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 18332, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 18332, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "135a78b5-5a3f-489d-8c0d-ecaac738387a", "uuid": "12291a1d-2291-4d6