{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_011Cg1zVZW7UArwvizsad5Jm", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<message to=\"discord-main\">\n**Re-cut for $2,500** \u2014 $625pp. Easiest fix is dropping one night and cooking a bit more; the trip shape stays the same.\n\n**5 days instead of 6** \u2014 cut Day 4 (the slow day), keep both outdoor days and the one paid attraction.\n\n| Item | Cost | vs. $3k plan |\n|---|---|---|\n| Fuel + tolls/parking | $300 | \u2014 |\n| Lodging (4 nights \u00d7 ~$175) | $700 | \u2212$250 |\n| Food | $600 | \u2212$100 |\n| Activities + entry fees | $350 | \u2212$100 |\n| Misc | $200 | \u2212$50 |\n| **Buffer** | **$350** | \u2014 |\n\n**What actually changed:** one fewer night, and the \"nice dinner\" becomes one meal out instead of two or three. Everything worth doing survives.\n\n**If you'd rather keep all 6 days:** stay 5 nights at ~$150 (shoulder-season or slightly further from the main town) and hold food to $500 by cooking breakfast and lunch daily. Tighter, but it works.\n\nStill happy to make this concrete \u2014 just need your home city and roughly when you're going.\n</message>"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1004, "cache_read_input_tokens": 18332, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 1004, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "135a78b5-5a3f-489d-8c0d-ecaac738387a", "uuid": "a7922b93-2855-4eda-b475-5d2ba281384d", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T10:44:01.335Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg1zVZ9HbJeqL42Nr1ee4"}
