{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_011Cg1zWVW39jwQq7i6xG1Lz", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<message to=\"discord-main\">\n**5-day road trip \u2014 4 people, $2,500**\n\n**Day 1 \u2014 Travel out**\nLeave mid-morning, 3\u20135 hrs drive. Grocery stop before you arrive (breakfasts, lunch supplies, snacks). Settle in, easy dinner at the rental.\n\n**Day 2 \u2014 Big outdoor day**\nHike, beach, or park \u2014 the free headline activity. Pack lunch. Casual dinner out if everyone's wiped.\n\n**Day 3 \u2014 The paid attraction**\nYour one splurge: aquarium, boat trip, theme park, guided tour. Full day. Eat there, budget for it.\n\n**Day 4 \u2014 Outdoors + town**\nMorning walk or second trail, afternoon in town \u2014 market, shops, wander. **This is the nice dinner.** The one proper sit-down meal of the trip.\n\n**Day 5 \u2014 Scenic route home**\nPack up, take the longer road back with one worthwhile stop. Lunch on the road.\n\n**Budget**\n| Item | Cost |\n|---|---|\n| Fuel + tolls/parking | $300 |\n| Lodging (4 nights \u00d7 ~$175, whole rental w/ kitchen) | $700 |\n| Food | $600 |\n| Activities + entry fees | $350 |\n| Misc / souvenirs | $200 |\n| **Buffer** | **$350** |\n| **Total** | **$2,500** |\n\n**Food breakdown** ($600 over 5 days, 4 people): ~$150 groceries up front covers all breakfasts and most lunches. That leaves ~$450 for roughly four meals out \u2014 three casual (~$80 each) and one proper dinner (~$150) on Day 4.\n\n**Two rules that keep this on budget:** book a whole rental with a kitchen rather than two hotel rooms, and keep it to one paid attraction. The $350 buffer is real \u2014 don't spend it in the planning stage.\n\nGive me your home city and rough dates and I'll turn this into an actual destination with real prices.\n</message>"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 838, "cache_read_input_tokens": 19336, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 838, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "135a78b5-5a3f-489d-8c0d-ecaac738387a", "uuid": "a3dfdf28-198c-4f21-9cd6-6fcb908980f9", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T10:44:11.697Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg1zWV9D9tTonKzbo2ggR"}
